flowchart TD
    A[Early K0 and target catalog] --> B[Program: metadata diff and authoritative synchronization]
    P[Optional predeclared independent MCP probes or source excerpts] --> E[Program: evidence IDs, hashes, subjects and scope]
    B --> E
    E --> SCOPE[Program: metadata-complete items and explicit semantic candidates]
    SCOPE --> LIGHT[LLM: lightweight directory screening for implicit impact or uncertainty]
    LIGHT --> UNION[Program: union candidates by tool ID, deduplicate]
    UNION --> C[LLM: one local review with rule edits in the same response]
    C --> U[Unresolved: withdraw suspect rules and mark unknown]
    C --> G[Program: scope and provenance gate; immutable metadata and typed evidence]
    U --> G
    G --> F[Frozen knowledge]
    F --> H[Same execution agent chooses tools and arguments]
    H --> Q{Python deliverable declared?}
    Q -->|No| N[Original delivery; Python checker not applicable]
    Q -->|Yes| S[Exact source saved and hashed; static checks]
    S --> T[Restricted Docker finite tests]
    T -->|Pass| O[Accept exact tested bytes; finite scope only]
    T -->|Observed functional failure| R[Same model, bounded completion-only repair]
    S -->|Syntax failure| R
    R --> S
    T -->|Unavailable or resource failure| X[Explicit unaccepted or unverified outcome]
    R -->|Budget exhausted| X
    Z[No Update and Full Rewrite remain unchanged; V5 scores compare full systems]
